  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You extend your arm and touch a willing creature within reach. For the duration of the spell, you see through the creatures eyes and hear what it hears. During this time, you lose of your own senses and are considered blinded, deafened, and stunned. You can end your mind vision as a free action on your turn.</p>",
